  {q:"How fast is delivery in Delhi NCR?", a:"In-stock items are dispatched same day. Delivery across Noida, Greater Noida, Delhi, Ghaziabad, Faridabad and Gurugram typically takes 1–2 days."},
  {q:"Are you a GST registered business?", a:"Yes — Garg Industrial Mesh is GST Verified. We provide proper GST invoices with every order so B2B buyers can claim input credit."}
