  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <p class="hero-kicker">Sector 9, Noida · Delhi NCR</p>
    <h1 class="hero-headline">Industrial Wire Mesh &amp; Perforated Sheets</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">SS, GI, MS, copper, brass &amp; aluminium — perforated sheets, expanded mesh, welded mesh, fencing, bird &amp; monkey spikes — wholesale from Garg Industrial Mesh.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-orange" data-ga="quote">Get Free Quote</a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/<%= site.whatsapp %>?text=<%= encodeURIComponent('Hi Garg Industrial Mesh, I would like a quote.') %>" class="link-wa link-wa-quiet" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-ga="whatsapp"><%- include('partials/_icon', {name:'whatsapp', size:16}) %> WhatsApp 9910238277</a>
